      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-6",
      "number": 6,
      "heading": "Prepare the garnish",
      "blocks": [
        "Finely chop the parsley including the stalks. Shave the hard cheese with a peeler."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [],
