    },
    {
      "id": "step-7",
      "number": 7,
      "heading": "Toss the pasta",
      "blocks": [
        "Stir the drained pasta through the ragù with a splash of starchy water, a knob of butter and freshly ground black pepper."
      ],
      "notes": [],
